30
00:01:52,460 --> 00:01:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

31
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?!</font>

32
00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:58,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you run away?!</font>

33
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:00,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

34
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't...</font>

35
00:02:28,290 --> 00:02:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">be staring at...</font>

36
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">people!</font>

37
00:02:40,890 --> 00:02:42,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's faster than earlier!</font>

38
00:02:49,890 --> 00:02:51,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The medicine from earlier...</font>

39
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was there some kind of
special ingredient in it or something...?</font>

40
00:02:57,690 --> 00:03:00,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not... bad...</font>

41
00:03:03,410 --> 00:03:09,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moving around kind of...
made me feel super weird...</font>

42
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my...!</font>

43
00:03:19,220 --> 00:03:21,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that... all of a sudden...?</font>

44
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he really... fall asleep...?</font>

45
00:03:37,530 --> 00:03:39,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fell for it, eh?!</font>

46
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looked like I was sleeping,
but actually I wasn't!</font>

47
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Shinobi secret...!</font>

48
00:03:52,670 --> 00:03:56,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei... I did it!</font>

49
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei... I... I...</font>

50
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fell for it yet again, huh?!
Hey!</font>

51
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're sorely mistaken
if you think I'm the kind of person</font>

52
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to sleep spread-eagle
in a place like this!</font>

53
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I...</font>

54
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? What am I doing
in a place like this...?</font>

55
00:04:53,100 --> 00:04:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

56
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:57,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...? Why...?</font>

57
00:05:10,990 --> 00:05:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alcohol...?</font>

58
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just drunk, huh...?</font>

59
00:05:16,290 --> 00:05:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so... I'll send you to another world
before you can even feel pain...</font>

60
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:57,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...
I don't have enough Chakra...</font>

61
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate...</font>

62
00:06:21,310 --> 00:06:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As might be expected,
things will get hairy</font>

63
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I stay in the water any longer
with this wound...</font>

64
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why won't it hit?!</font>

65
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:36,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And here I was sleeping comfortably...</font>

66
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a buzzing, annoying fly!</font>

67
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Bring it on! Hey c'mon...
I'll show you...</font>

68
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:57,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're... those movements...?</font>

69
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:01,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As you know, in that technique...</font>

70
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one gets stronger the more one drinks
and the more one gets drunk.</font>

71
00:08:08,590 --> 00:08:09,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

72
00:08:10,210 --> 00:08:11,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the restaurant before...</font>

73
00:08:11,970 --> 00:08:16,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Lee mistook it for water
and drank a small cup of alcohol...</font>

74
00:08:32,530 --> 00:08:37,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It took Neji and me, the both of us,
to finally... be able to overpower Lee.</font>

75
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:43,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You couldn't restrain him yourself...?</font>

76
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could overpower him
if I was fighting him as an enemy...</font>

77
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:52,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But well, I couldn't inflict a serious
injury on my beloved student...</font>

78
00:08:53,220 --> 00:08:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

79
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:57,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's how it was
just with one small cup, so...</font>

80
00:08:58,890 --> 00:09:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he were to drink
an entire bottle of alcohol...</font>

81
00:09:03,350 --> 00:09:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An invincible strength, huh...?</font>

82
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's just after
he got out of the hospital.</font>

83
00:09:10,570 --> 00:09:12,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long will his body
hold on for...?</font>

84
00:09:22,290 --> 00:09:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Drunken Fist user, huh...?
It's my first time seeing one...</font>

85
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're not going to come...
then I'll go!</font>

86
00:09:35,050 --> 00:09:38,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His attacks are straight as usual...</font>

87
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

88
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:47,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ouch!</font>

89
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's your fault!</font>

90
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:05,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I...!</font>

91
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm enjoying my youth!</font>

92
00:10:13,170 --> 00:10:14,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's too unorthodox...</font>

93
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And most of all... he's fast!</font>

94
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:21,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right in the middle of my youth...</font>

95
00:10:30,690 --> 00:10:32,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dance of the Camellia!</font>

96
00:10:38,490 --> 00:10:39,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

97
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't read his movements...</font>

98
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:32,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An attack on me...
That's quite some Taijutsu...</font>

99
00:11:33,540 --> 00:11:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no choice...</font>

100
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:49,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My attack ability is bones...</font>

101
00:11:50,390 --> 00:11:53,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You heard that earlier
from the Clone brat, right...?</font>

102
00:11:55,770 --> 00:11:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll sober you up right away.</font>

103
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:02,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... not drunk... or anything!</font>

104
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:06,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll wake you up!</font>

105
00:12:09,250 --> 00:12:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not drunk or anything!</font>

106
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:13,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place, I'm a minor!</font>

107
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Minors shouldn't drink at all!</font>

108
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:38,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unorthodox, isn't it...?
This is my Kekkei Genkai.</font>

109
00:13:00,550 --> 00:13:04,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down... Think of a strategy...</font>

110
00:13:06,590 --> 00:13:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seek... some kind of possibility...</font>

111
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph. With that wound...</font>

112
00:13:25,820 --> 00:13:29,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he wasn't able
to escape very far at all...</font>

113
00:13:38,710 --> 00:13:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my limit...
I can't move...</font>

114
00:13:49,350 --> 00:13:52,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...
He's already caught up?</font>

115
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

116
00:14:16,250 --> 00:14:18,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My head's pounding...</font>

117
00:14:19,330 --> 00:14:21,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what's with this wound...?</font>

118
00:14:22,170 --> 00:14:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems I was drunk, eh...?</font>

119
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your appearance...!</font>

120
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you've sobered up...
This is my Kekkei Genkai...</font>

121
00:14:35,970 --> 00:14:38,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kekkei Genkai...</font>

122
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:45,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Kekkei Genkai freely controls
osteoblastic and osteoclastic cells...</font>

123
00:14:46,900 --> 00:14:52,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It even controls the concentration
of calcium. It's an ability to form bones.</font>

124
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:57,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Basically, there are over two hundred
bones in the human body...</font>

125
00:14:57,830 --> 00:15:01,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But for me, that's not a set number.</font>

126
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:11,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But bones are bones, after all!</font>

127
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they break, they break!</font>

128
00:15:20,230 --> 00:15:21,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What a hardness...!</font>

129
00:15:23,230 --> 00:15:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are these really human bones...?!</font>

130
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so...!</font>

131
00:15:32,950 --> 00:15:34,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Larch Dance.</font>

132
00:16:01,190 --> 00:16:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had it...</font>

133
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A little more... you loser.</font>

134
00:16:07,690 --> 00:16:10,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like the time before with Asuma...</font>

135
00:16:24,330 --> 00:16:25,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Asuma!</font>

136
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:33,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's probably zero possibility
of someone coming to help...</font>

137
00:16:34,590 --> 00:16:38,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what's the point of thinking
about someone helping...?!</font>

138
00:16:38,810 --> 00:16:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Calm down!</font>

139
00:17:33,570 --> 00:17:35,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The smell is moving away...</font>

140
00:17:38,780 --> 00:17:39,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saved...</font>

141
00:17:40,700 --> 00:17:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who is?</font>

142
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How...?!</font>

143
00:17:47,170 --> 00:17:48,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it...</font>

144
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My coat?!</font>

145
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems you didn't notice your own smell
that you're routinely used to smelling...</font>

146
00:17:59,930 --> 00:18:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that you erased your own smell?</font>

147
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand well the attributes of scent.
It figures why I didn't smell you.</font>

148
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... as would be expected,</font>

149
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's tough having you guys split up in two
to search for me...</font>

150
00:18:17,490 --> 00:18:18,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...</font>

151
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please wait!</font>

152
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real deal... is from now!</font>

153
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My role now is to stall this person
as long as possible...</font>

154
00:18:44,970 --> 00:18:49,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I should've avoided a big technique
that could be self-defeating...</font>

155
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:53,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it seems this isn't an opponent
easy enough to be able to beat</font>

156
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:55,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">without using my Secret Technique...</font>

157
00:18:59,030 --> 00:18:59,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

158
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just had surgery
and am not at my best.</font>

159
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:08,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if it'd just be opening the first of the
Eight Inner Gates, The Gate of Opening,</font>

160
00:19:08,660 --> 00:19:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should somehow...</font>

161
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:15,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The first gate... Gate of Opening...</font>

162
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open!</font>

163
00:19:20,090 --> 00:19:21,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Primary Lotus!</font>

164
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:31,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The impact of the kick
was suppressed by the bones...?!</font>

165
00:19:31,730 --> 00:19:35,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's some speed... But it's over.</font>

166
00:19:36,860 --> 00:19:42,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it... No matter how much I think,
I can't come up with any good strategies!</font>

167
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had it... can't hold any further...</font>

168
00:19:49,750 --> 00:19:53,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With me right in front of you,
you can't even howl like a loser...?</font>

169
00:19:54,670 --> 00:19:55,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eh?!</font>

170
00:19:59,090 --> 00:19:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

171
00:20:01,090 --> 00:20:02,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mine!</font>

172
00:20:03,430 --> 00:20:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you be smiling
before you're going to die!</font>

173
00:20:17,070 --> 00:20:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

174
00:20:25,870 --> 00:20:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?!</font>

175
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh... It seems
you're an ally this time...</font>

176
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?!</font>

177
