222
00:22:38,330 --> 00:22:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I heard that the Sand and Leaf
had made up, but...</font>

223
00:22:41,170 --> 00:22:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It wasn't that we attacked the Leaf Village
